    {
      "id": "sticky-overview",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -504,
        -280
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Insurance claims triage\n\n**Reference architecture.**\n\nClaims arrive by email or API and are normalised into one shape. Claude extracts the claim details, the policy is checked in the CRM, and lapsed policies get a reply instead of a queue slot.\n\nSeverity is assessed against a fixed schema, a rules step checks fraud indicators, and the claim is routed to the right adjuster team. Suspected fraud alerts the investigations team.\n\n**Every decision is written to an audit log** for regulatory review.",
        "width": 420,
        "height": 560,
        "color": 7
      }
    },
